  {
    heading: 'Lodges and Accommodation',
    body: [
      'Rwanda has invested heavily in its tourism infrastructure and Volcanoes National Park has some of the finest lodges in Africa, including Singita Kwitonda, One&Only Gorilla\'s Nest and Bisate Lodge. These are genuinely world-class properties at high-end international prices.',
